      "id": "순서",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "순서"
    },
    {
      "id": "시작하기-전에",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "시작하기 전에"
    }
  ],
  "html": "<p>지금까지 개념을 하나씩 봤습니다. 이제 <strong>처음부터 끝까지 직접 만들어 봅니다.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong>Copilot을 쓰지 않고 손으로 만듭니다.</strong> 말로 시키면 빠르지만, 한 번은 직접 놓고 이어 봐야\nCopilot이 만든 것을 읽고 고칠 수 있습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"만들-것--문의-접수-도우미\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#만들-것--문의-접수-도우미\" class=\"peer\">만들 것 — 문의 접수 도우미</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>고객 문의가 들어오면 <strong>AI가 긴급한지 판단해서, 상황에 맞는 안내문을 만들어 주는</strong> 워크플로우입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 py-6\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-3.5 dark:border-slate-700\"><div class=\"mb-2.5 flex flex-wrap items-stretch gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><div class=\"min-w-[120px] rounded-lg border px-2.5 py-2 bg-amber-100 border-amber-300 dark:bg-amber-950 dark:border-amber-700\"><div class=\"mb-0.5 text-[10px] text-fd-muted-foreground\">트리거</div><div class=\"font-medium text-fd-foreground text-xs\">Start</div><div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug\">문의 내용을 받습니다</div></div><span class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground text-sm\">→</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><div class=\"min-w-[120px] rounded-lg border px-2.5 py-2 bg-fd-muted border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\"><div class=\"mb-0.5 text-[10px] text-fd-muted-foreground\">Agent</div><div class=\"font-medium text-fd-foreground text-xs\">분류봇</div><div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug\">긴급한지 판단하고 한 줄로 요약</div></div><span class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground text-sm\">→</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><div class=\"min-w-[120px] rounded-lg border px-2.5 py-2 bg-blue-100 border-blue-300 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:border-blue-700\"><div class=\"mb-0.5 text-[10px] text-fd-muted-foreground\">Condition</div><div class=\"font-medium text-fd-foreground text-xs\">긴급인가</div><div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug\">긴급이면 위로, 아니면 아래로</div></div></div></div><div class=\"ml-2 flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-slate-200 border-l-2 pl-4 dark:border-slate-700\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"min-w-[76px] font-mono text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground\">if — 긴급</span><span class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground text-sm\">→</span><div class=\"min-w-[120px] rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-fd-muted px-2.5 py-1.5 dark:border-slate-700\"><div class=\"mb-0.5 text-[10px] text-fd-muted-foreground\">Agent</div><div class=\"font-medium text-fd-foreground text-xs\">긴급안내</div><div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug\">바로 연락하겠다는 안내문</div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"min-w-[76px] font-mono text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground\">else — 보통</span><span class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground text-sm\">→</span><div class=\"min-w-[120px] rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-fd-muted px-2.5 py-1.5 dark:border-slate-700\"><div class=\"mb-0.5 text-[10px] text-fd-muted-foreground\">Agent</div><div class=\"font-medium text-fd-foreground text-xs\">일반안내</div><div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug\">접수되었다는 안내문</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 border-dashed bg-fd-muted px-4 py-3 dark:border-slate-600\"><div class=\"mb-1 text-fd-muted-foreground text-xs\">이 예제로 익히는 것</div><div class=\"font-medium text-fd-foreground text-sm\">트리거로 <span class=\"text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">입력을 받고</span>, AI에게<!-- --> <span class=\"text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">일을 맡기고</span>, 조건으로<!-- --> <span class=\"text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">길을 가르는</span> 것 — 대부분의 워크플로우가 이 모양입니다.</div></div></div>\n<p>돌려 보면 이런 식으로 동작합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>넣은 문의</th><th>나오는 결과</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&quot;결제했는데 서비스가 안 열립니다. 지금 급합니다.&quot;</td><td>긴급으로 판단 → <strong>바로 연락하겠다는 안내문</strong></td></tr><tr><td>&quot;요금제 종류가 궁금합니다.&quot;</td><td>보통으로 판단 → <strong>접수되었다는 안내문</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"왜-이-예제인가요\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#왜-이-예제인가요\" class=\"peer\">왜 이 예제인가요</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>처음 만드는 워크플로우로 알맞은 이유가 있습니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>준비물이 없습니다.</strong> 메일이나 메신저 계정을 연결하지 않아도 끝까지 완성됩니다.</li>\n<li><strong>바깥으로 나가는 것이 없습니다.</strong> 아무리 돌려 봐도 누구에게도 메일이 가지 않습니다.</li>\n<li><strong>가장 흔한 모양입니다.</strong> 입력 → AI 처리 → 조건 분기는 실무 워크플로우 대부분의 뼈대입니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>완성한 뒤 마지막 안내문 블록을 <strong>메신저로 보내는 블록</strong>으로 바꾸면 곧바로 실무에 쓸 수 있습니다.\n그때 계정 연결만 하면 됩니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"순서\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#순서\" class=\"peer\">순서</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>세 단계로 나눠 만듭니다. <strong>각 단계가 끝날 때마다 한 번씩 돌려 보고</strong> 다음으로 넘어갑니다.</p>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>만드는 것</th><th>익히는 것</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>1단계</strong></td><td><code>Start</code> → <code>분류봇</code></td><td>입력 받기, AI에게 시키기, 앞 결과 가져다 쓰기</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2단계</strong></td><td><code>긴급인가</code> → 두 갈래 안내문</td><td>조건으로 길 가르기, 여러 갈래 잇기</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3단계</strong></td><td>확인하고 내보내기</td><td>테스트, 버전 저장, 배포</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-warning, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong>한 단계씩 하세요.</strong> 세 단계를 한꺼번에 만들고 마지막에 돌리면,\n잘못됐을 때 어디가 문제인지 찾기 어렵습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"시작하기-전에\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#시작하기-전에\" class=\"peer\">시작하기 전에</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>새 워크플로우를 하나 만들어 둡니다.</p>\n<p>왼쪽 사이드바 <code>Workflows</code> 옆의 <strong><code>＋</code></strong> 버튼을 누르면, <code>Start</code> 블록 하나만 있는 빈 캔버스가 열립니다.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>이름을 알아보기 쉽게 바꿔 두세요. 워크플로우 이름을 눌러 <strong><code>문의 접수 도우미</code></strong> 처럼 고칠 수 있습니다.\n나중에 목록에서 찾기 편합니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<p>준비가 됐다면 1단계로 넘어갑니다.</p>"
}